  },
  {
    "id": 9977845596164,
    "text": "\"You fought for class equality, decentralization and ultra democracy. In the end you won, so you must preserve the status quo.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9977845596165,
    "text": "\"You destroyed the machine with practical common sense and culture, then set fire to its blueprints. You are too smart to believe that democracy is freedom.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9977845596166,
    "text": "\"You see society as a body, and your duty is to balance its organs. When one fails, all do. You heal thoughts.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9977845596167,
    "text": "\"You lost the war a long time ago – even though you were right. You believe in free markets, the license to be wrong, and that capitalist society is the best option we’ve got left.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9977845596168,
    "text": "\"When you were young, you believed in words – now, you believe in acts. If the earth trembles before cultural dilution, you are the constant. History is written by settlers.\"",
    "metadata": {
      "m_Items": []
    }
  },
